# ==========================================================
# Ask Nazir AI — environment variables
# ==========================================================
#
# 1. Get a FREE Google Gemini API key (no credit card required):
#    https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#
# 2. Copy this file:    cp .env.example .env.local
#
# 3. Paste your real key below (it must start with "AIza...").
#
# 4. Restart the dev server:  npm run dev
#
# Notes:
# - .env.local is git-ignored, so the key never leaves your machine.
# - The chatbot uses gemini-2.5-flash (free tier ~1,500 req/day).
# - If the key is missing or invalid, the assistant falls back to a
#   built-in resume Q&A so the chat never breaks for visitors.
#
GOOGLE_API_KEY=AIzaSy_your_real_key_here
